      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-3-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3(2) Objects",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-3-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "(2) These objects are to be achieved by:\n(a) establishing an accreditation scheme for entities providing\ndigital ID services; and\n(b) providing additional privacy safeguards for the provision of\naccredited digital ID services; and\n(c) establishing an Australian Government Digital ID System\nthat is secure, easy to use, voluntary, accessible, inclusive\nand reliable; and\n(d) strengthening the oversight and regulation of:\n(i) accredited digital ID service providers; and\n(ii) entities participating in the Australian Government\nDigital ID System; and\n(iii) the integrity and performance of the Australian\nGovernment Digital ID System.\n\nIntroduction  Chapter 1\nPreliminary  Part 1\n\nSection 4\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
      "skos:definition": "(2) These objects are to be achieved by:\n(a) establishing an accreditation scheme for entities providing\ndigital ID services; and\n(b) providing additional privacy safeguards for the provision of\naccredited digital ID services; and\n(c) establishing an Australian Government Digital ID System\nthat is secure, easy to use, voluntary, accessible, inclusive\nand reliable; and\n(d) strengthening the oversight and regulation of:\n(i) accredited digital ID service providers; and\n(ii) entities participating in the Australian Government\nDigital ID System; and\n(iii) the integrity and performance of the Australian\nGovernment Digital ID System.\n\nIntroduction  Chapter 1\nPreliminary  Part 1\n\nSection 4\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-3"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-3-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-3-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "15f1405d3cfdb231407abfe8609281879968ae1c64d6e958d9f08dea98edb141",
      "skos:note": "Establishing an accreditation scheme and providing additional privacy safeguards for digital ID services."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-3-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3(2) Objects",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 14,
      "values:originalText": "(2) These objects are to be achieved by:\n(a) establishing an accreditation scheme for entities providing\ndigital ID services; and\n(b) providing additional privacy safeguards for the provision of\naccredited digital ID services; and\n(c) establishing an Australian Government Digital ID System\nthat is secure, easy to use, voluntary, accessible, inclusive\nand reliable; and\n(d) strengthening the oversight and regulation of:\n(i) accredited digital ID service providers; and\n(ii) entities participating in the Australian Government\nDigital ID System; and\n(iii) the integrity and performance of the Australian\nGovernment Digital ID System.\n\nIntroduction  Chapter 1\nPreliminary  Part 1\n\nSection 4\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-3-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-3-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
