    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-10-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10(2) Meaning of attribute of an individual",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-10-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), an attribute of an individual\nincludes the following:\n(a) the individual’s current or former name;\n(b) the individual’s current or former address;\n(c) the individual’s date of birth;\n(d) information about whether the individual is alive or dead;\n(e) the individual’s phone number;\n(f) the individual’s email address;\n(g) if the individual has a digital ID—the time and date the\ndigital ID was created;\n(h) biometric information of the individual;\n(i) a restricted attribute of the individual;\n(j) information or an opinion about the individual’s:\n(i) racial or ethnic origin; or\n(ii) political opinions; or\n(iii) membership of a political association; or\n(iv) religious beliefs or affiliations; or\n(v) philosophical beliefs; or\n(vi) sexual orientation or practices.\n\nIntroduction  Chapter 1\nInterpretation  Part 2\n\nSection 11\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), an attribute of an individual\nincludes the following:\n(a) the individual’s current or former name;\n(b) the individual’s current or former address;\n(c) the individual’s date of birth;\n(d) information about whether the individual is alive or dead;\n(e) the individual’s phone number;\n(f) the individual’s email address;\n(g) if the individual has a digital ID—the time and date the\ndigital ID was created;\n(h) biometric information of the individual;\n(i) a restricted attribute of the individual;\n(j) information or an opinion about the individual’s:\n(i) racial or ethnic origin; or\n(ii) political opinions; or\n(iii) membership of a political association; or\n(iv) religious beliefs or affiliations; or\n(v) philosophical beliefs; or\n(vi) sexual orientation or practices.\n\nIntroduction  Chapter 1\nInterpretation  Part 2\n\nSection 11\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-10"
      },
