        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(i) the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory; or"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-11-ss-1-logic-ltl-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "includes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Includes trace of restricted attribute usage",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(ii) an authority or agency of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory; or"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-11-ss-1-logic-diffusion-6",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "includes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Includes diffusion of restricted attribute information",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(iii) a government of a foreign country; or"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-11-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11(2) Meaning of restricted attribute of an individual",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-11-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting paragraph (1)(b), an identifier of an individual\nincludes the following:\n(a) the individual’s tax file number (within the meaning of\nsection 202A of the Income Tax Assessment Act 1936);\n(b) the individual’s medicare number (within the meaning of\nPart VII of the National Health Act 1953);\n(c) the individual’s healthcare identifier (within the meaning of\nthe Healthcare Identifiers Act 2010);\n(d) if the person holds a driver’s licence issued under the law of\na State or Territory—the number of that driver’s licence.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Without limiting paragraph (1)(b), an identifier of an individual\nincludes the following:\n(a) the individual’s tax file number (within the meaning of\nsection 202A of the Income Tax Assessment Act 1936);\n(b) the individual’s medicare number (within the meaning of\nPart VII of the National Health Act 1953);\n(c) the individual’s healthcare identifier (within the meaning of\nthe Healthcare Identifiers Act 2010);\n(d) if the person holds a driver’s licence issued under the law of\na State or Territory—the number of that driver’s licence.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-11"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-11-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "527b54aba6bc967c906a46a739e7a5ffc4c84e4c36274275c7cfead4392e6d68",
      "skos:note": "Defines what constitutes an individual's identifier."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-11-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "11(2) Meaning of restricted attribute of an individual",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 27,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting paragraph (1)(b), an identifier of an individual\nincludes the following:\n(a) the individual’s tax file number (within the meaning of\nsection 202A of the Income Tax Assessment Act 1936);\n(b) the individual’s medicare number (within the meaning of\nPart VII of the National Health Act 1953);\n(c) the individual’s healthcare identifier (within the meaning of\nthe Healthcare Identifiers Act 2010);\n(d) if the person holds a driver’s licence issued under the law of\na State or Territory—the number of that driver’s licence."
    },
