      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The Digital ID Regulator must accredit an entity.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Digital ID Regulator must not accredit an entity."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-15-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Timing of accreditation refusal",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "A direction under subsection 27(1) (about security) directing the Digital ID Regulator to refuse to accredit the entity is in force.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The accreditation refusal occurs during this time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-15-ss-4-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "not",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Negative obligation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The Digital ID Regulator must accredit an entity if it can comply with this Act.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Digital ID Regulator must not accredit an entity if it cannot comply."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-16",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16 Accreditation is subject to conditions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-16"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The accreditation of an entity as an accredited entity is subject to\nthe following conditions (the accreditation conditions):\n(a) the conditions set out in subsection 17(1);\n\nAccreditation  Chapter 2\nAccreditation  Part 2\nAccreditation  Division 2\nSection 17\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025\n(b) the conditions (if any) imposed by the Digital ID Regulator\nunder subsection 17(2), including as varied under\nsubsection 20(1);\n(c) the conditions (if any) determined by the Accreditation Rules\nunder subsection 17(5).\n(2) An accredited entity must comply with the accreditation conditions\nthat apply to the entity.\nNote:\nFailure to comply with an accreditation condition may result in a\nsuspension or revocation of the entity’s accreditation (see sections 25\nand 26).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The accreditation of an entity as an accredited entity is subject to\nthe following conditions (the accreditation conditions):\n(a) the conditions set out in subsection 17(1);\n\nAccreditation  Chapter 2\nAccreditation  Part 2\nAccreditation  Division 2\nSection 17\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025\n(b) the conditions (if any) imposed by the Digital ID Regulator\nunder subsection 17(2), including as varied under\nsubsection 20(1);\n(c) the conditions (if any) determined by the Accreditation Rules\nunder subsection 17(5).\n(2) An accredited entity must comply with the accreditation conditions\nthat apply to the entity.\nNote:\nFailure to comply with an accreditation condition may result in a\nsuspension or revocation of the entity’s accreditation (see sections 25\nand 26).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-16-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-16-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "da4a581750efac8a782548fffe61cbb3ec56fc7ef1c33b04eab67f89d810e299"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-16",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16 Accreditation is subject to conditions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 32,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The accreditation of an entity as an accredited entity is subject to\nthe following conditions (the accreditation conditions):\n(a) the conditions set out in subsection 17(1);\n\nAccreditation  Chapter 2\nAccreditation  Part 2\nAccreditation  Division 2\nSection 17\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025\n(b) the conditions (if any) imposed by the Digital ID Regulator\nunder subsection 17(2), including as varied under\nsubsection 20(1);\n(c) the conditions (if any) determined by the Accreditation Rules\nunder subsection 17(5).\n(2) An accredited entity must comply with the accreditation conditions\nthat apply to the entity.\nNote:\nFailure to comply with an accreditation condition may result in a\nsuspension or revocation of the entity’s accreditation (see sections 25\nand 26)."
    },
