    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-17-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "17(4) Conditions on accreditation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-17-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.33",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Without limiting paragraph (2)(a), the Digital ID Regulator may\nimpose conditions relating to the following:\n(a) any limitations, exclusions or restrictions in relation to the\naccredited services of the entity;\n(b) the circumstances or manner in which the accredited services\nof the entity must be provided;\n\nChapter 2  Accreditation",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Without limiting paragraph (2)(a), the Digital ID Regulator may\nimpose conditions relating to the following:\n(a) any limitations, exclusions or restrictions in relation to the\naccredited services of the entity;\n(b) the circumstances or manner in which the accredited services\nof the entity must be provided;\n\nChapter 2  Accreditation",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-17"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-17-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
