    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-21-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "21 Applying for variation or revocation of conditions on",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-21-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.37",
      "values:originalText": "accreditation\n(1) An accredited entity may apply for a condition imposed on the\nentity’s accreditation under paragraph 17(2)(a) to be varied or\nrevoked.\nNote:\nSee Part 5 of Chapter 9 for matters relating to applications.\n(2) If, after receiving an application under subsection (1), the Digital\nID Regulator refuses to vary or revoke a condition, the Digital ID\nRegulator must give to the entity written notice of the refusal,\nincluding reasons for the refusal.",
      "skos:definition": "accreditation\n(1) An accredited entity may apply for a condition imposed on the\nentity’s accreditation under paragraph 17(2)(a) to be varied or\nrevoked.\nNote:\nSee Part 5 of Chapter 9 for matters relating to applications.\n(2) If, after receiving an application under subsection (1), the Digital\nID Regulator refuses to vary or revoke a condition, the Digital ID\nRegulator must give to the entity written notice of the refusal,\nincluding reasons for the refusal.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-21-2-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-21-2-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7df3253d5d95627da56a964423854d42743189f3d6bd9896b01f4aa9036f05e4"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-21-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "21 Applying for variation or revocation of conditions on",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 37,
      "values:originalText": "accreditation\n(1) An accredited entity may apply for a condition imposed on the\nentity’s accreditation under paragraph 17(2)(a) to be varied or\nrevoked.\nNote:\nSee Part 5 of Chapter 9 for matters relating to applications.\n(2) If, after receiving an application under subsection (1), the Digital\nID Regulator refuses to vary or revoke a condition, the Digital ID\nRegulator must give to the entity written notice of the refusal,\nincluding reasons for the refusal."
    },
