    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-22",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "22 Notice before changes to conditions on accreditation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-22"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.37",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Digital ID Regulator must not, on the Digital ID Regulator’s\nown initiative:\n(a) impose a condition under paragraph 17(2)(a) on an entity’s\naccreditation after the entity has been accredited; or\n(b) vary or revoke a condition under subsection 20(1);\nunless the Digital ID Regulator has given the entity a written notice\nin accordance with subsection (2) of this section.\n(2) The notice must:\n(a) state the proposed condition, variation or revocation; and\n(b) request the entity to give the Digital ID Regulator, within the\nperiod specified in the notice, a written statement relating to\nthe proposed condition, variation or revocation.\n\nChapter 2  Accreditation",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Digital ID Regulator must not, on the Digital ID Regulator’s\nown initiative:\n(a) impose a condition under paragraph 17(2)(a) on an entity’s\naccreditation after the entity has been accredited; or\n(b) vary or revoke a condition under subsection 20(1);\nunless the Digital ID Regulator has given the entity a written notice\nin accordance with subsection (2) of this section.\n(2) The notice must:\n(a) state the proposed condition, variation or revocation; and\n(b) request the entity to give the Digital ID Regulator, within the\nperiod specified in the notice, a written statement relating to\nthe proposed condition, variation or revocation.\n\nChapter 2  Accreditation",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-22-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-22-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "931967ce2dfde3b69c2c7058c869f6ff0526695c3ff4dbe4ce47d7d57b6df9e4"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-22",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22 Notice before changes to conditions on accreditation",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 37,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Digital ID Regulator must not, on the Digital ID Regulator’s\nown initiative:\n(a) impose a condition under paragraph 17(2)(a) on an entity’s\naccreditation after the entity has been accredited; or\n(b) vary or revoke a condition under subsection 20(1);\nunless the Digital ID Regulator has given the entity a written notice\nin accordance with subsection (2) of this section.\n(2) The notice must:\n(a) state the proposed condition, variation or revocation; and\n(b) request the entity to give the Digital ID Regulator, within the\nperiod specified in the notice, a written statement relating to\nthe proposed condition, variation or revocation.\n\nChapter 2  Accreditation"
    },
