    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-23",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23 Notice of decision of changes to conditions on accreditation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-23"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.38",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to subsection (2), the Digital ID Regulator must give an\nentity written notice of a decision to impose, vary or revoke a\ncondition on an entity’s accreditation.\n(2) The Digital ID Regulator is not required to give an entity notice of\nthe decision if notice of the condition was given in a notice under\nsubsection 15(7).\n(3) The notice must:\n(a) state the condition or the variation, or state that the condition\nis revoked; and\n(b) state the day on which the condition, variation or revocation\ntakes effect.\n\nAccreditation  Chapter 2\nAccreditation  Part 2\nVarying, suspending and revoking accreditation  Division 3\nSection 24\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to subsection (2), the Digital ID Regulator must give an\nentity written notice of a decision to impose, vary or revoke a\ncondition on an entity’s accreditation.\n(2) The Digital ID Regulator is not required to give an entity notice of\nthe decision if notice of the condition was given in a notice under\nsubsection 15(7).\n(3) The notice must:\n(a) state the condition or the variation, or state that the condition\nis revoked; and\n(b) state the day on which the condition, variation or revocation\ntakes effect.\n\nAccreditation  Chapter 2\nAccreditation  Part 2\nVarying, suspending and revoking accreditation  Division 3\nSection 24\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-23-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-23-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-23-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dc515f831f8d4ac716579ca1268c49283201e9b7058405b9b3cd70915f0f2223"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-23",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23 Notice of decision of changes to conditions on accreditation",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 38,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to subsection (2), the Digital ID Regulator must give an\nentity written notice of a decision to impose, vary or revoke a\ncondition on an entity’s accreditation.\n(2) The Digital ID Regulator is not required to give an entity notice of\nthe decision if notice of the condition was given in a notice under\nsubsection 15(7).\n(3) The notice must:\n(a) state the condition or the variation, or state that the condition\nis revoked; and\n(b) state the day on which the condition, variation or revocation\ntakes effect.\n\nAccreditation  Chapter 2\nAccreditation  Part 2\nVarying, suspending and revoking accreditation  Division 3\nSection 24\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025"
    },
