      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.39",
      "values:originalText": "The Digital ID Regulator may vary the accreditation of an\naccredited entity to take account of a change in the accredited\nentity’s name.\nNote:\nThe Digital ID Regulator can also vary conditions on accreditation\n(see section 20).",
      "skos:definition": "The Digital ID Regulator may vary the accreditation of an\naccredited entity to take account of a change in the accredited\nentity’s name.\nNote:\nThe Digital ID Regulator can also vary conditions on accreditation\n(see section 20).",
      "cml:asserts": [
