      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.50",
      "values:originalText": "providing accredited services\nThis Chapter applies to an accredited entity only to the extent the\nentity is providing its accredited services.",
      "skos:definition": "providing accredited services\nThis Chapter applies to an accredited entity only to the extent the\nentity is providing its accredited services.",
