      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.50",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The entities are as follows:\n(a) a department or authority of a State;\n\nPrivacy  Chapter 3\nIntroduction  Part 1\n\nSection 34\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025\n(b) a department or authority of a Territory.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The entities are as follows:\n(a) a department or authority of a State;\n\nPrivacy  Chapter 3\nIntroduction  Part 1\n\nSection 34\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025\n(b) a department or authority of a Territory.",
