      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.50",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister must provide the Information Commissioner with a\ncopy of an APP-equivalent agreement within 14 days after it is\nentered into.\n\nChapter 3  Privacy",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Minister must provide the Information Commissioner with a\ncopy of an APP-equivalent agreement within 14 days after it is\nentered into.\n\nChapter 3  Privacy",
