    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-35",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "35 Extended meaning of personal information in relation to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-35"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.52",
      "values:originalText": "accredited entities\nTo the extent not already covered by the definition of personal\ninformation within the Privacy Act 1988, attributes of individuals,\nto the extent that they are in the possession or control of accredited\nentities, are taken, for the purposes of that Act, to be personal\ninformation about an individual.\nNote 1:\nThis section has the effect of extending the meaning of personal\ninformation in the Privacy Act 1988 as it applies to accredited entities\nto mirror the meaning of that term as it is used in this Act (see\nsection 9).\nNote 2:\nThis means that the requirements in the Privacy Act 1988 about\ncollecting, using and disclosing personal information under that Act\nextend to attributes of individuals to the extent that information is in\nthe possession or control of accredited entities. However, this applies\nonly to the extent the information is collected, used or disclosed when\nthose entities are providing their accredited services (see section 33).",
      "skos:definition": "accredited entities\nTo the extent not already covered by the definition of personal\ninformation within the Privacy Act 1988, attributes of individuals,\nto the extent that they are in the possession or control of accredited\nentities, are taken, for the purposes of that Act, to be personal\ninformation about an individual.\nNote 1:\nThis section has the effect of extending the meaning of personal\ninformation in the Privacy Act 1988 as it applies to accredited entities\nto mirror the meaning of that term as it is used in this Act (see\nsection 9).\nNote 2:\nThis means that the requirements in the Privacy Act 1988 about\ncollecting, using and disclosing personal information under that Act\nextend to attributes of individuals to the extent that information is in\nthe possession or control of accredited entities. However, this applies\nonly to the extent the information is collected, used or disclosed when\nthose entities are providing their accredited services (see section 33).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-35-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-35-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-35-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8a53e16cb4a399c0b44b46ddb9ba54061ec55ea5ae30951a87a5002036047c84",
      "skos:note": "Attributes of individuals in possession or control of accredited entities are considered personal information."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-35",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "35 Extended meaning of personal information in relation to",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 52,
      "values:originalText": "accredited entities\nTo the extent not already covered by the definition of personal\ninformation within the Privacy Act 1988, attributes of individuals,\nto the extent that they are in the possession or control of accredited\nentities, are taken, for the purposes of that Act, to be personal\ninformation about an individual.\nNote 1:\nThis section has the effect of extending the meaning of personal\ninformation in the Privacy Act 1988 as it applies to accredited entities\nto mirror the meaning of that term as it is used in this Act (see\nsection 9).\nNote 2:\nThis means that the requirements in the Privacy Act 1988 about\ncollecting, using and disclosing personal information under that Act\nextend to attributes of individuals to the extent that information is in\nthe possession or control of accredited entities. However, this applies\nonly to the extent the information is collected, used or disclosed when\nthose entities are providing their accredited services (see section 33)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-35-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-35"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-35-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "takes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Attributes are taken as personal information.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-35-logic-descriptionlogic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "is mirror of",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Meaning is mirrored from the Privacy Act 1988.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Section 9"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-35a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "35A Small business operator that is an accredited entity",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-35a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.52",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a small business operator is an accredited entity, the Privacy Act\n1988 applies, with the prescribed modifications (if any), in relation\nto the small business operator as if it were an organisation.\n(2) In this section:\norganisation has the same meaning as in the Privacy Act 1988.\nprescribed modifications means modifications prescribed by the\nDigital ID Rules for the purposes of this definition.\nsmall business operator has the same meaning as in the Privacy\nAct 1988.\n\nPrivacy  Chapter 3\nPrivacy  Part 2\nInteraction with the Privacy Act 1988  Division 1\nSection 36\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If a small business operator is an accredited entity, the Privacy Act\n1988 applies, with the prescribed modifications (if any), in relation\nto the small business operator as if it were an organisation.\n(2) In this section:\norganisation has the same meaning as in the Privacy Act 1988.\nprescribed modifications means modifications prescribed by the\nDigital ID Rules for the purposes of this definition.\nsmall business operator has the same meaning as in the Privacy\nAct 1988.\n\nPrivacy  Chapter 3\nPrivacy  Part 2\nInteraction with the Privacy Act 1988  Division 1\nSection 36\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-35a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-35a-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e3e38a97df3469c6fc6adf723c4a2ff434e8ec44e9652157024db9330a21b031"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-35a",
