    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-38-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "38(3) Contraventions of Division 2 and section 136 are interferences",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-38-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.54",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The entity is taken, for the purposes of Part V of the Privacy Act\n1988 and any other provision of that Act that relates to that Part, to\nbe an organisation if:\n(a) the act or practice of the entity that contravenes a provision\nof Division 2 of this Part or section 136 is the subject of a\ncomplaint to, or an investigation by, the Information\nCommissioner under Part V of the Privacy Act 1988; and\n(b) the entity is not an agency or organisation.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The entity is taken, for the purposes of Part V of the Privacy Act\n1988 and any other provision of that Act that relates to that Part, to\nbe an organisation if:\n(a) the act or practice of the entity that contravenes a provision\nof Division 2 of this Part or section 136 is the subject of a\ncomplaint to, or an investigation by, the Information\nCommissioner under Part V of the Privacy Act 1988; and\n(b) the entity is not an agency or organisation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-38"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-38-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-38-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-38-ss-3-logic-ltl-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-38-ss-3-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-38-ss-3-logic-deontic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-38-ss-3-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "64f8edc2cceb4697feb637e8552873e73e266a2b617a1e4caa9ae102bdea7fcc",
      "skos:note": "Entity must be considered an organisation if it is subject to a complaint or investigation under Part V of the Privacy Act 1988."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-38-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "38(3) Contraventions of Division 2 and section 136 are interferences",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 54,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The entity is taken, for the purposes of Part V of the Privacy Act\n1988 and any other provision of that Act that relates to that Part, to\nbe an organisation if:\n(a) the act or practice of the entity that contravenes a provision\nof Division 2 of this Part or section 136 is the subject of a\ncomplaint to, or an investigation by, the Information\nCommissioner under Part V of the Privacy Act 1988; and\n(b) the entity is not an agency or organisation."
    },
