      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 59,
      "values:originalText": "(2) An accredited entity must not disclose a restricted attribute of an\nindividual to a relying party that is not a participating relying party\nif the accredited entity’s conditions on accreditation do not include\nan authorisation to disclose the restricted attribute to the relying\nparty.\n\nChapter 3  Privacy"
