      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.60",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if:\n(a) an accredited entity (the assigning entity) assigns a unique\nidentifier to an individual within a digital ID system; and\n(b) the assigning entity discloses the unique identifier to another\naccredited entity or to a relying party.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if:\n(a) an accredited entity (the assigning entity) assigns a unique\nidentifier to an individual within a digital ID system; and\n(b) the assigning entity discloses the unique identifier to another\naccredited entity or to a relying party.",
      "values:partOf": {
