      "skos:definition": "(2) The assigning entity must not disclose the unique identifier to any\nother entity other than:\n(a) if the unique identifier was disclosed to another accredited\nentity—the other accredited entity; or\n(b) if the unique identifier was disclosed to a relying party—the\nrelying party.\nCivil penalty:\n1,500 penalty units.",
