      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.60",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Subsections (2) and (3) also do not apply if the unique identifier is\ndisclosed to another entity if the other entity is facilitating access to\nthe entity for whom the unique identifier was created.\nNote:\nA person who wishes to rely on this subsection bears an evidential\nburden in relation to the matter mentioned in this subsection (see\nsection 96 of the Regulatory Powers Act).",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Subsections (2) and (3) also do not apply if the unique identifier is\ndisclosed to another entity if the other entity is facilitating access to\nthe entity for whom the unique identifier was created.\nNote:\nA person who wishes to rely on this subsection bears an evidential\nburden in relation to the matter mentioned in this subsection (see\nsection 96 of the Regulatory Powers Act).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-47"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-47-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-47-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "437419de1f8dd5b77667673892d71815c9335c000ddee23b4acf1137b2c1bfd4",
      "skos:note": "A person who wishes to rely on this subsection bears an evidential burden."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-47-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "47(6) Restricting disclosure of unique identifiers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 60,
      "values:originalText": "(6) Subsections (2) and (3) also do not apply if the unique identifier is\ndisclosed to another entity if the other entity is facilitating access to\nthe entity for whom the unique identifier was created.\nNote:\nA person who wishes to rely on this subsection bears an evidential\nburden in relation to the matter mentioned in this subsection (see\nsection 96 of the Regulatory Powers Act)."
    },
    {
