    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-49-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "49(1) Authorised collection, use and disclosure of biometric",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 62,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An accredited entity is authorised to collect, use or disclose\nbiometric information of an individual if:\n(a) the accredited entity’s conditions on accreditation authorise\nthe collection, use, or disclosure of the biometric\ninformation; and\n(b) the biometric information of the individual is collected, used\nor disclosed for the purposes of the accredited entity doing\neither or both of the following:\n(i) verifying the identity of the individual;\n(ii) authenticating the individual to their digital ID."
    },
