    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-49-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "49(4) Authorised collection, use and disclosure of biometric",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-49-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Subsection (3) applies despite:\n(a) any law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory\n(whether enacted or made before or after this subsection); or\n(b) a warrant (other than a warrant of a kind mentioned in\nparagraph (3)(a)), authorisation or order issued under such a\nlaw.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Subsection (3) applies despite:\n(a) any law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory\n(whether enacted or made before or after this subsection); or\n(b) a warrant (other than a warrant of a kind mentioned in\nparagraph (3)(a)), authorisation or order issued under such a\nlaw.",
      "values:partOf": {
