    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-49-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "49(6) Authorised collection, use and disclosure of biometric",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-49-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "(6) An accredited entity is authorised to retain, use or disclose\nbiometric information of an individual if:\n(a) the accredited entity collected the information in accordance\nwith subsection (1); and\n(b) the information is retained, used or disclosed for the purposes\nof undertaking testing in relation to the information; and\n\nChapter 3  Privacy",
      "skos:definition": "(6) An accredited entity is authorised to retain, use or disclose\nbiometric information of an individual if:\n(a) the accredited entity collected the information in accordance\nwith subsection (1); and\n(b) the information is retained, used or disclosed for the purposes\nof undertaking testing in relation to the information; and\n\nChapter 3  Privacy",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-49"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-49-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-49-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "25c09b3945dd630b4dea8281111e82ea739fa49c8d249cc1bb784ddace239bb0",
      "skos:note": "Accredited entity may retain, use or disclose biometric information for testing purposes."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-49-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "49(6) Authorised collection, use and disclosure of biometric",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 62,
      "values:originalText": "(6) An accredited entity is authorised to retain, use or disclose\nbiometric information of an individual if:\n(a) the accredited entity collected the information in accordance\nwith subsection (1); and\n(b) the information is retained, used or disclosed for the purposes\nof undertaking testing in relation to the information; and\n\nChapter 3  Privacy"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-49-ss-6-norm",
