      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(6) An accredited entity is authorised to...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...retain, use or disclose biometric information of an individual."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-49a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "49A Biometric information, testing and continuous improvement",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-49a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.65",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if an accredited entity is authorised to retain,\nuse or disclose biometric information of individuals under\nsubsection 49(6) (about testing).\n(2) The accredited entity must take reasonable steps to continuously\nimprove its biometric systems to ensure such systems do not\nselectively disadvantage or discriminate against any group.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if an accredited entity is authorised to retain,\nuse or disclose biometric information of individuals under\nsubsection 49(6) (about testing).\n(2) The accredited entity must take reasonable steps to continuously\nimprove its biometric systems to ensure such systems do not\nselectively disadvantage or discriminate against any group.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
