      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.71",
      "values:originalText": "attributes of individuals\n(1) This section applies if, during an authenticated session, an\naccredited identity exchange provider receives any of the following\nattributes of an individual:\n(a) a restricted attribute of the individual;\n(b) the individual’s name;\n(c) the individual’s address;\n\nChapter 3  Privacy",
      "skos:definition": "attributes of individuals\n(1) This section applies if, during an authenticated session, an\naccredited identity exchange provider receives any of the following\nattributes of an individual:\n(a) a restricted attribute of the individual;\n(b) the individual’s name;\n(c) the individual’s address;\n\nChapter 3  Privacy",
