      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "61416ba968cd1f20f22a60a301479bec3d14857e480b861c35053a3470990782",
      "skos:note": "Refusal of approval to participate in the Australian Government Digital ID System"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-62-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "62(4) Approval to participate in the Australian Government Digital ID",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 80,
      "values:originalText": "(4) However, the Digital ID Regulator must not approve an entity to\nparticipate in the Australian Government Digital ID System if a\ndirection under subsection 73(1) (about security) directing the\nDigital ID Regulator to refuse to approve the entity is in force."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-62-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
