    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-65-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "65(2) Conditions relating to restricted attributes of individuals",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-65-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.85",
      "values:originalText": "(2) In deciding whether to impose the condition, the Digital ID\nRegulator must have regard to the following matters:\n(a) whether the entity has provided sufficient justification for the\nneed to collect or disclose the restricted attribute;\n(b) whether the entity has demonstrated that a similar outcome\ncannot be achieved without collecting or disclosing the\nrestricted attribute;\n(c) if the collection or disclosure of the restricted attribute is\nregulated by other legislative or regulatory requirements—\n\nChapter 4  Australian Government Digital ID System",
      "skos:definition": "(2) In deciding whether to impose the condition, the Digital ID\nRegulator must have regard to the following matters:\n(a) whether the entity has provided sufficient justification for the\nneed to collect or disclose the restricted attribute;\n(b) whether the entity has demonstrated that a similar outcome\ncannot be achieved without collecting or disclosing the\nrestricted attribute;\n(c) if the collection or disclosure of the restricted attribute is\nregulated by other legislative or regulatory requirements—\n\nChapter 4  Australian Government Digital ID System",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-65"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-65-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-65-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6d2460a6facbf02200a003803b6064f339f1e72b19b944f48c24bbe5639f81a7",
      "skos:note": "Entity must provide justification for collecting or disclosing restricted attribute.",
      "dc:description": "(a) whether the entity has provided sufficient justification for the need to collect or disclose the restricted attribute;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-65-ss-2",
