    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-68-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "68(5) Notice before changes to conditions on approval",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-68-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.88",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If this section does not apply to an entity because of subsection (4),\nthe Digital ID Regulator must give a written statement of reasons\nto the entity as to why the Digital ID Regulator reasonably believes\nthat the need to impose, vary or revoke the condition is serious and\nurgent.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If this section does not apply to an entity because of subsection (4),\nthe Digital ID Regulator must give a written statement of reasons\nto the entity as to why the Digital ID Regulator reasonably believes\nthat the need to impose, vary or revoke the condition is serious and\nurgent.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-68"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-68-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-68-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "176edcd6236e5a754e46489f34ab04fa5fefad887cc5d9efe871db4d705d0c14",
      "skos:note": "Entity must receive written statement of reasons from Digital ID Regulator.",
      "dc:description": "written statement of reasons"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-68-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "68(5) Notice before changes to conditions on approval",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 88,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If this section does not apply to an entity because of subsection (4),\nthe Digital ID Regulator must give a written statement of reasons\nto the entity as to why the Digital ID Regulator reasonably believes\nthat the need to impose, vary or revoke the condition is serious and\nurgent."
    },
