      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.89",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The notice must:\n(a) state the condition or the variation, or state that the condition\nis revoked; and\n(b) state the day on which the condition, variation or revocation\ntakes effect.\n\nChapter 4  Australian Government Digital ID System",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The notice must:\n(a) state the condition or the variation, or state that the condition\nis revoked; and\n(b) state the day on which the condition, variation or revocation\ntakes effect.\n\nChapter 4  Australian Government Digital ID System",
