      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.90",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The Digital ID Regulator may, on application by an entity, suspend\nan approval given to the entity under section 62.\nNote:\nSee Part 5 of Chapter 9 for matters relating to applications.\nShow cause notice must generally be given before decision to\nsuspend",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The Digital ID Regulator may, on application by an entity, suspend\nan approval given to the entity under section 62.\nNote:\nSee Part 5 of Chapter 9 for matters relating to applications.\nShow cause notice must generally be given before decision to\nsuspend",
