      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Despite subsection (3), a direction given under subsection (1) to\nrevoke the approval of an entity to participate in the Australian\nGovernment Digital ID System cannot be revoked.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Despite subsection (3), a direction given under subsection (1) to\nrevoke the approval of an entity to participate in the Australian\nGovernment Digital ID System cannot be revoked.",
