      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 99,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Digital ID Regulator must not revoke an exemption granted to\nan entity under subsection 74(4) unless the Digital ID Regulator\nhas given the entity a written notice in accordance with\nsubsection (2) of this section."
    },
