    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-81-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "81(2) Entities may conduct testing in the Australian Government",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 104,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The authorisation:\n(a) must be in writing; and\n(b) must specify the period for which it is in force, which must\nnot exceed 3 months; and\n(c) may be granted unconditionally or subject to conditions.\nNote:\nThe System Administrator may vary or revoke the authorisation: see\nsubsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."
