      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.104",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If an authorisation under this section is given subject to a condition\nand the condition is not met at a particular time, the authorisation\nceases to be in force at that time.\n\nAustralian Government Digital ID System  Chapter 4\nAustralian Government Digital ID System  Part 2\nOther matters relating to the Australian Government Digital ID System  Division 5\nSection 82\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If an authorisation under this section is given subject to a condition\nand the condition is not met at a particular time, the authorisation\nceases to be in force at that time.\n\nAustralian Government Digital ID System  Chapter 4\nAustralian Government Digital ID System  Part 2\nOther matters relating to the Australian Government Digital ID System  Division 5\nSection 82\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-81"
      },
