    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-82",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "82 Use and disclosure of personal information to conduct testing",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-82"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.105",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An accredited entity may use or disclose personal information of\nan individual if:\n(a) the accredited entity uses or discloses the information for the\npurposes of conducting testing in the Australian Government\nDigital ID System; and\n(b) the accredited entity or another entity is authorised under\nsection 81 to conduct the testing using the information; and\n(c) the individual to whom the information relates has expressly\nconsented to the use or disclosure of the information for that\npurpose.\n(2) This section applies despite anything else in this Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An accredited entity may use or disclose personal information of\nan individual if:\n(a) the accredited entity uses or discloses the information for the\npurposes of conducting testing in the Australian Government\nDigital ID System; and\n(b) the accredited entity or another entity is authorised under\nsection 81 to conduct the testing using the information; and\n(c) the individual to whom the information relates has expressly\nconsented to the use or disclosure of the information for that\npurpose.\n(2) This section applies despite anything else in this Act.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-82-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-82-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "215e318a18447924d9f52b7f5281dea0c5c713e99ffc70d6f3e23e533470fedc"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-82",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "82 Use and disclosure of personal information to conduct testing",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 105,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An accredited entity may use or disclose personal information of\nan individual if:\n(a) the accredited entity uses or discloses the information for the\npurposes of conducting testing in the Australian Government\nDigital ID System; and\n(b) the accredited entity or another entity is authorised under\nsection 81 to conduct the testing using the information; and\n(c) the individual to whom the information relates has expressly\nconsented to the use or disclosure of the information for that\npurpose.\n(2) This section applies despite anything else in this Act."
    },
