      "values:originalText": "(1B) This subsection applies if:\n(a) the first entity does not comply with this Act (other than the\nservice levels determined under section 80) in relation to the\naccredited service; and\n(b) the non-compliance is not the ground or cause for the action\nor other proceeding."
