      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.106",
      "values:originalText": "(2) An entity that wishes to rely on subsection (1) in relation to an\naction or other proceeding bears an evidential burden (within the\nmeaning of the Regulatory Powers Act) in relation to that matter.\n\nAustralian Government Digital ID System  Chapter 4\nLiability and redress framework  Part 3\nStatutory contract  Division 2\nSection 85\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
      "skos:definition": "(2) An entity that wishes to rely on subsection (1) in relation to an\naction or other proceeding bears an evidential burden (within the\nmeaning of the Regulatory Powers Act) in relation to that matter.\n\nAustralian Government Digital ID System  Chapter 4\nLiability and redress framework  Part 3\nStatutory contract  Division 2\nSection 85\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
      "values:partOf": {
