      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.123",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Digital ID Data Standards Chair is to be appointed by the\nMinister by written instrument.\nNote:\nThe Minister will be the Digital ID Data Standards Chair in the\nabsence of an appointment under this section (see the definition of\nDigital ID Data Standards Chair in section 9).\n(2) The Digital ID Data Standards Chair is to be appointed on a\nfull-time or part-time basis.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Digital ID Data Standards Chair is to be appointed by the\nMinister by written instrument.\nNote:\nThe Minister will be the Digital ID Data Standards Chair in the\nabsence of an appointment under this section (see the definition of\nDigital ID Data Standards Chair in section 9).\n(2) The Digital ID Data Standards Chair is to be appointed on a\nfull-time or part-time basis.",
