      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.123",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Digital ID Data Standards Chair is to be appointed on a\nfull-time or part-time basis.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Digital ID Data Standards Chair is to be appointed on a\nfull-time or part-time basis.",
