      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.125",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Subsections 7(9) and (13) of the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973\ndo not apply in relation to the office of the Digital ID Data\nStandards Chair.\nNote:\nThe effect of this subsection is that remuneration or allowances of the\nDigital ID Data Standards Chair will be paid out of money\nappropriated by an Act other than the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Subsections 7(9) and (13) of the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973\ndo not apply in relation to the office of the Digital ID Data\nStandards Chair.\nNote:\nThe effect of this subsection is that remuneration or allowances of the\nDigital ID Data Standards Chair will be paid out of money\nappropriated by an Act other than the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-109"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
