      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.126",
      "values:originalText": "The Digital ID Data Standards Chair must not engage in paid work\noutside the duties of the Digital ID Data Standards Chair’s office\nwithout the Minister’s approval.",
      "skos:definition": "The Digital ID Data Standards Chair must not engage in paid work\noutside the duties of the Digital ID Data Standards Chair’s office\nwithout the Minister’s approval.",
