      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.126",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the\nMinister or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that\nlater day.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the\nMinister or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that\nlater day.",
