    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-115",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "115 Arrangements relating to staff",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-115"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.128",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The staff assisting the Digital ID Data Standards Chair are to be:\n(a) APS employees in the Department whose services are made\navailable to the Chair, by the Secretary, in connection with\nthe performance of any of the Chair’s functions or the\nexercise of any of the Chair’s powers; or\n(b) APS employees in another Department of the\nCommonwealth whose services are made available to the\nChair, by the Secretary of that Department, in connection\nwith the performance of any of the Chair’s functions or the\nexercise of any of the Chair’s powers.\n(2) When performing services for the Digital ID Data Standards Chair,\nthe staff are subject to the directions of the Chair.\n\nTrustmarks and registers  Chapter 8\nIntroduction  Part 1\n\nSection 116\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025\nChapter 8—Trustmarks and registers",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The staff assisting the Digital ID Data Standards Chair are to be:\n(a) APS employees in the Department whose services are made\navailable to the Chair, by the Secretary, in connection with\nthe performance of any of the Chair’s functions or the\nexercise of any of the Chair’s powers; or\n(b) APS employees in another Department of the\nCommonwealth whose services are made available to the\nChair, by the Secretary of that Department, in connection\nwith the performance of any of the Chair’s functions or the\nexercise of any of the Chair’s powers.\n(2) When performing services for the Digital ID Data Standards Chair,\nthe staff are subject to the directions of the Chair.\n\nTrustmarks and registers  Chapter 8\nIntroduction  Part 1\n\nSection 116\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025\nChapter 8—Trustmarks and registers",
      "cml:hasPart": [
