      "cml:premiseText": "(3) An entity must not do any of the following in relation to a mark, symbol, logo or design so closely resembling a digital ID trustmark as to be likely to lead a reasonable person to believe that the entity is an accredited entity or a participating relying party:",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The temporal interval for using digital ID trustmark is 3 years."
