    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-120-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "120(4) Digital ID Accredited Entities Register",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-120-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.132",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If an entity’s accreditation is revoked and the entity does not\nbecome an accredited entity again for 12 months after the day the\nrevocation came into force, the Digital ID Regulator must remove\nthe entity from the Digital ID Accredited Entities Register at the\nend of that period.\n\nTrustmarks and registers  Chapter 8\nRegisters  Part 3\n\nSection 121\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If an entity’s accreditation is revoked and the entity does not\nbecome an accredited entity again for 12 months after the day the\nrevocation came into force, the Digital ID Regulator must remove\nthe entity from the Digital ID Accredited Entities Register at the\nend of that period.\n\nTrustmarks and registers  Chapter 8\nRegisters  Part 3\n\nSection 121\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-120"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-120-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-120-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-120-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a287f6fff3260efc272598635785cb1d0e71963ff6f64ea785d2436d2b34ab18",
      "skos:note": "Entity removal from register after revocation and non-reaccreditation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-120-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "120(4) Digital ID Accredited Entities Register",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 132,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If an entity’s accreditation is revoked and the entity does not\nbecome an accredited entity again for 12 months after the day the\nrevocation came into force, the Digital ID Regulator must remove\nthe entity from the Digital ID Accredited Entities Register at the\nend of that period.\n\nTrustmarks and registers  Chapter 8\nRegisters  Part 3\n\nSection 121\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025"
    },
