      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 138,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of Part 5 of the Regulatory Powers Act, the\nrelevant chief executive is:\n(a) in relation to the provisions mentioned in paragraph (2)(a) of\nthis section—the Information Commissioner; and\n(b) in relation to the provisions mentioned in paragraph (2)(b) of\nthis section—the Digital ID Regulator.\n\nAdministration  Chapter 9\nCompliance and enforcement  Part 2\nEnforcement powers  Division 1\nSection 125\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-124-ss-3-norm",
