    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-126-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "126(3) Injunctions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 140,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of Part 7 of the Regulatory Powers Act, each of\nthe following courts is a relevant court in relation to the provisions\nmentioned in subsection (1):\n(a) the Federal Court of Australia;\n(b) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 2);\n(c) a court of a State or Territory that has jurisdiction in relation\nto the matter.\n\nAdministration  Chapter 9\nCompliance and enforcement  Part 2\nDirections powers  Division 2\nSection 127\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025"
    },
