    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-127-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "127(2) Digital ID Regulator’s power to give directions to entities in",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-127-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.141",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a direction may:\n(a) require an accredited identity exchange provider to:\n(i) provide information to an entity that holds an approval\nto participate in the Australian Government Digital ID\nSystem about the steps required to connect to the\nsystem; and\n(ii) connect the entity to the Australian Government Digital\nID System by a specified date; or\n\nChapter 9  Administration",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a direction may:\n(a) require an accredited identity exchange provider to:\n(i) provide information to an entity that holds an approval\nto participate in the Australian Government Digital ID\nSystem about the steps required to connect to the\nsystem; and\n(ii) connect the entity to the Australian Government Digital\nID System by a specified date; or\n\nChapter 9  Administration",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-127"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-127-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-127-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a4c95755d9488362f828d19686cdc3ea7dae0383eab302561f5da27a14443f7c",
      "skos:note": "Entities must provide information and connect to the Australian Government Digital ID System by a specified date.",
      "dc:description": "True"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-127-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "127(2) Digital ID Regulator’s power to give directions to entities in",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 141,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a direction may:\n(a) require an accredited identity exchange provider to:\n(i) provide information to an entity that holds an approval\nto participate in the Australian Government Digital ID\nSystem about the steps required to connect to the\nsystem; and\n(ii) connect the entity to the Australian Government Digital\nID System by a specified date; or\n\nChapter 9  Administration"
    },
    {
