      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.142",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if the Digital ID Regulator reasonably believes\nthat an accredited entity, or an entity whose accreditation is\nsuspended, has contravened, or is contravening, a provision of this\nAct.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if the Digital ID Regulator reasonably believes\nthat an accredited entity, or an entity whose accreditation is\nsuspended, has contravened, or is contravening, a provision of this\nAct.",
