      "cml:integrityHash": "038b62084d5773ad8607658fda6a3b4e93a361b710e986598250d883432c5408",
      "skos:note": "The Digital ID Regulator may give a direction to protect the integrity or performance of the Australian Government Digital ID System. The Digital ID Regulator has the power to give directions to protect against contraventions of this Act."
    },
