      "values:originalText": "(2) The Digital ID Regulator may give the entity a direction requiring\nthe entity to take specified action directed towards ensuring that the\nentity does not contravene the provision, or is unlikely to\ncontravene the provision, in the future.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Digital ID Regulator may give the entity a direction requiring\nthe entity to take specified action directed towards ensuring that the\nentity does not contravene the provision, or is unlikely to\ncontravene the provision, in the future.",
