      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 149,
      "values:originalText": "(6) Subsection (5) does not apply if the entity has a reasonable excuse.\nNote:\nA person who wishes to rely on this subsection bears an evidential\nburden in relation to the matter mentioned in this subsection (see\nsection 96 of the Regulatory Powers Act).\n\nChapter 9  Administration"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-133-ss-6-norm",
