      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.150",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Subsection (5) does not apply if the entity has a reasonable excuse.\nNote:\nA person who wishes to rely on this subsection bears an evidential\nburden in relation to the matter mentioned in this subsection (see\nsection 96 of the Regulatory Powers Act).\n\nAdministration  Chapter 9\nRecord keeping  Part 3\n\nSection 135\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Subsection (5) does not apply if the entity has a reasonable excuse.\nNote:\nA person who wishes to rely on this subsection bears an evidential\nburden in relation to the matter mentioned in this subsection (see\nsection 96 of the Regulatory Powers Act).\n\nAdministration  Chapter 9\nRecord keeping  Part 3\n\nSection 135\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
