      "values:originalText": "(2) The person to whom the application is made may accept any\ninformation or document previously given to the person in\nconnection with another application made under this Act as\nsatisfying any requirement to give that information or document\nunder subsection (1).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The person to whom the application is made may accept any\ninformation or document previously given to the person in\nconnection with another application made under this Act as\nsatisfying any requirement to give that information or document\nunder subsection (1).",
