      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.159",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the Digital ID Regulator requires a compliance assessment to be\nconducted for the purposes of making a decision under this Act, the\nDigital ID Regulator is not required to make the decision until the\nassessment is conducted.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If the Digital ID Regulator requires a compliance assessment to be\nconducted for the purposes of making a decision under this Act, the\nDigital ID Regulator is not required to make the decision until the\nassessment is conducted.",
