      "skos:note": "Commonwealth not liable to pay fees charged by entities that are part of the Commonwealth."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-147-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "147(1) Commonwealth not liable to pay fees charged by entities that",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 162,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commonwealth is not liable to pay a fee that is payable under\nthis Act to a part of the Commonwealth that is not a separate legal\nentity. However, it is the Parliament’s intention that the\nCommonwealth should be notionally liable to pay such a fee."
    },
