      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.162",
      "values:originalText": "(5) In this subsection:\nCommonwealth includes a Commonwealth entity (within the\nmeaning of the Public Governance, Performance and\nAccountability Act 2013) that cannot be made liable to taxation by\na law of the Commonwealth.\n\nAdministration  Chapter 9\nFees  Part 6\nFees charged by accredited entities  Division 2\nSection 148\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025",
