        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "188292a942d6d726c083b44e6e963e55d12f605997d6b4580095801ef78488ec",
      "skos:note": "Accredited entities can charge fees for their services."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-148-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "148(5) Charging of fees by accredited entities in relation to the",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 163,
      "values:originalText": "(5) This section, and rules made for the purposes of subsection (2), do\nnot otherwise affect the ability of an accredited entity to charge\nfees for its accredited services, either in relation to the Australian\nGovernment Digital ID System or otherwise.\n\nChapter 10  Other matters"
    },
    {
