      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 170,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to:\n(a) a law enforcement agency, if the agency requests or requires,\nduring a financial year, an accredited entity to disclose\nbiometric information of an individual obtained as part of the\nprovision of the entity’s accredited services; or\n(b) an enforcement body, if the body requests or requires, during\na financial year, an accredited entity to use or disclose\npersonal information of an individual obtained as part of the\nprovision of the entity’s accredited services for the purposes\nof enforcement related activities conducted by, or on behalf\nof, the enforcement body.\nNote:\nAn accredited entity is authorised to disclose biometric information of\nan individual to a law enforcement agency only in certain\ncircumstances, such as under a warrant (see subsection 49(3)). An\naccredited entity can disclose personal information of an individual to\nan enforcement body in certain circumstances, but the personal\ninformation must not be biometric information (see section 54)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155a-ss-1-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155a-ss-1"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155a-ss-1-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must provide",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The law enforcement agency or enforcement body must request or require the accredited entity to disclose biometric information or personal information.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The accredited entity MUST provide biometric information or personal information."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155a-ss-1-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must use or disclose",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The enforcement body must request or require the accredited entity to use or disclose personal information of an individual for enforcement-related activities.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The accredited entity MUST use or disclose personal information of an individual for enforcement-related activities."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155a-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "BETWEEN",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Disclosure must occur during a financial year.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The law enforcement agency or enforcement body MUST request or require the accredited entity to disclose biometric information or personal information DURING a financial year.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The disclosure of biometric information or personal information OCCURS BETWEEN the start and end of a financial year."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155a-ss-1-logic-ltl-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "RECURSIVE",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Disclosure must be recurring for enforcement-related activities.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The enforcement body MUST request or require the accredited entity to use or disclose personal information of an individual FOR ENFORCEMENT-RELATED ACTIVITIES CONDUCTED BY, OR ON BEHALF OF, THE ENFORCEMENT BODY.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The disclosure of personal information of an individual is RECURSIVE for enforcement-related activities."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "155A(2) Annual reports by law enforcement agencies etc. on disclosure",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-155a-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.170",
      "values:originalText": "(2) At the end of the financial year, the law enforcement agency or the\nenforcement body (as the case requires) must prepare and give a\nreport to the AFP Minister that includes the following:\n(a) the total number of requests or requirements made by the\nagency or body during the financial year;\n(b) details of the type of information requested or required (but\nnot including personal information of a particular individual\n\nOther matters  Chapter 10\nOther matters  Part 4\n\nSection 155B\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025\nor details that would identify a particular individual) during\nthe financial year;\n(c) the total number of requests or requirements that were\ncomplied with (in whole or in part) by an accredited entity\nduring the financial year.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) At the end of the financial year, the law enforcement agency or the\nenforcement body (as the case requires) must prepare and give a\nreport to the AFP Minister that includes the following:\n(a) the total number of requests or requirements made by the\nagency or body during the financial year;\n(b) details of the type of information requested or required (but\nnot including personal information of a particular individual\n\nOther matters  Chapter 10\nOther matters  Part 4\n\nSection 155B\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025\nor details that would identify a particular individual) during\nthe financial year;\n(c) the total number of requests or requirements that were\ncomplied with (in whole or in part) by an accredited entity\nduring the financial year.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155a-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155a-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155a-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "16d96090bcda3a152ea5f1fa538bdcc36c000903c87bab72463c829281c67c3a",
      "skos:note": "Annual report on disclosure of information by law enforcement agencies",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-155a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "155A(2) Annual reports by law enforcement agencies etc. on disclosure",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 170,
      "values:originalText": "(2) At the end of the financial year, the law enforcement agency or the\nenforcement body (as the case requires) must prepare and give a\nreport to the AFP Minister that includes the following:\n(a) the total number of requests or requirements made by the\nagency or body during the financial year;\n(b) details of the type of information requested or required (but\nnot including personal information of a particular individual\n\nOther matters  Chapter 10\nOther matters  Part 4\n\nSection 155B\nDigital ID Act 2024\nCompilation date: 21/02/2025\nor details that would identify a particular individual) during\nthe financial year;\n(c) the total number of requests or requirements that were\ncomplied with (in whole or in part) by an accredited entity\nduring the financial year."
    },
