    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155b-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "155B(3) Annual report by AFP Minister",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-155b-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.171",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If subsection (2) does not apply, the report by the AFP Minister\nmust include the following in relation to each law enforcement\nagency and enforcement body that provided a section 155A report\nfor the financial year:\n(a) the total number of requests or requirements made by the law\nenforcement agency or enforcement body during the financial\nyear;\n(b) details of the type of information requested or required (but\nnot including personal information of a particular individual\nor details that would identify a particular individual) by the\nlaw enforcement agency or enforcement body during the\nfinancial year;\n(c) the total number of requests or requirements made by the law\nenforcement agency or enforcement body that were complied\nwith (in whole or in part) by an accredited entity during the\nfinancial year.\n\nChapter 10  Other matters",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If subsection (2) does not apply, the report by the AFP Minister\nmust include the following in relation to each law enforcement\nagency and enforcement body that provided a section 155A report\nfor the financial year:\n(a) the total number of requests or requirements made by the law\nenforcement agency or enforcement body during the financial\nyear;\n(b) details of the type of information requested or required (but\nnot including personal information of a particular individual\nor details that would identify a particular individual) by the\nlaw enforcement agency or enforcement body during the\nfinancial year;\n(c) the total number of requests or requirements made by the law\nenforcement agency or enforcement body that were complied\nwith (in whole or in part) by an accredited entity during the\nfinancial year.\n\nChapter 10  Other matters",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155b-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155b-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155b-ss-3-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-155b-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "31437e4d873792c40ae8e5cf2355ba57d860e2cd7566692ffb207bc0aad251e6",
      "skos:note": "Annual report by AFP Minister must include specific information about law enforcement agencies' requests and compliance.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
