    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "156(3) How this Act applies in relation to non-legal persons",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-156-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.172",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A provision of this Act (including a civil penalty provision) that is\npurportedly contravened by an entity that is not a legal person is\ninstead contravened by each accountable person for the entity who:\n(a) did the relevant act or made the relevant omission; or\n(b) aided, abetted, counselled or procured the relevant act or\nomission; or\n(c) was in any way knowingly concerned in, or party to, the\nrelevant act or omission.\nMeaning of accountable person",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A provision of this Act (including a civil penalty provision) that is\npurportedly contravened by an entity that is not a legal person is\ninstead contravened by each accountable person for the entity who:\n(a) did the relevant act or made the relevant omission; or\n(b) aided, abetted, counselled or procured the relevant act or\nomission; or\n(c) was in any way knowingly concerned in, or party to, the\nrelevant act or omission.\nMeaning of accountable person",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-3-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-3-logic-deontic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-3-logic-argumentation-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e7f2de51c8179db496264ccc1d4721d43bcdb634f18a64bcb84f3b76412d1d4a",
      "skos:note": "Accountable persons for non-legal entities are liable for contraventions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-156-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "156(3) How this Act applies in relation to non-legal persons",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 172,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A provision of this Act (including a civil penalty provision) that is\npurportedly contravened by an entity that is not a legal person is\ninstead contravened by each accountable person for the entity who:\n(a) did the relevant act or made the relevant omission; or\n(b) aided, abetted, counselled or procured the relevant act or\nomission; or\n(c) was in any way knowingly concerned in, or party to, the\nrelevant act or omission.\nMeaning of accountable person"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
