      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Accountable persons have an obligation to comply.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) A provision of this Act (including a civil penalty provision) that is purportedly contravened by an entity that is not a legal person...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...is instead contravened by each accountable person for the entity..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Overlaps",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The liability of accountable persons overlaps with that of the entity.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) was in any way knowingly concerned in, or party to, the relevant act or omission.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...or (c) was in any way knowingly concerned in, or party to, the relevant act or omission."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-3-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Repeats",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The liability of accountable persons repeats with each occurrence.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) A provision of this Act (including a civil penalty provision)...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...is instead contravened by each accountable person for the entity who:..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-3-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The liability of accountable persons is an obligation.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) A provision of this Act (including a civil penalty provision)...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...is instead contravened by each accountable person for the entity..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-3-logic-argumentation-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Implication",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The liability of accountable persons implies that they have a duty to comply.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) A provision of this Act (including a civil penalty provision)...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...is instead contravened by each accountable person for the entity who:..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "156(4) How this Act applies in relation to non-legal persons",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-156-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.172",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of this section, a person is an accountable person\nfor an entity at a particular time if:\n(a) in the case of a partnership in which one or more of the\npartners is an individual—the individual is a partner in the\npartnership at that time; or\n(b) in the case of a partnership in which one or more of the\npartners is a body corporate—the person is a director of the\nbody corporate at that time; or\n(c) in the case of a trust in which the trustee, or one or more of\nthe trustees, is an individual—the individual is a trustee of\nthe trust at that time; or\n(d) in the case of a trust in which the trustee, or one or more of\nthe trustees, is a body corporate—the person is a director of\nthe body corporate at that time; or\n(e) in the case of an unincorporated association—the person is a\nmember of the governing body of the unincorporated\nassociation at that time.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of this section, a person is an accountable person\nfor an entity at a particular time if:\n(a) in the case of a partnership in which one or more of the\npartners is an individual—the individual is a partner in the\npartnership at that time; or\n(b) in the case of a partnership in which one or more of the\npartners is a body corporate—the person is a director of the\nbody corporate at that time; or\n(c) in the case of a trust in which the trustee, or one or more of\nthe trustees, is an individual—the individual is a trustee of\nthe trust at that time; or\n(d) in the case of a trust in which the trustee, or one or more of\nthe trustees, is a body corporate—the person is a director of\nthe body corporate at that time; or\n(e) in the case of an unincorporated association—the person is a\nmember of the governing body of the unincorporated\nassociation at that time.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "16494cb7635133e7b4a269d6bc0d77c104e28cfa2926e94d23f7bb07b71004f2",
      "skos:note": "Definition of accountable person for an entity"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-156-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "156(4) How this Act applies in relation to non-legal persons",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 172,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of this section, a person is an accountable person\nfor an entity at a particular time if:\n(a) in the case of a partnership in which one or more of the\npartners is an individual—the individual is a partner in the\npartnership at that time; or\n(b) in the case of a partnership in which one or more of the\npartners is a body corporate—the person is a director of the\nbody corporate at that time; or\n(c) in the case of a trust in which the trustee, or one or more of\nthe trustees, is an individual—the individual is a trustee of\nthe trust at that time; or\n(d) in the case of a trust in which the trustee, or one or more of\nthe trustees, is a body corporate—the person is a director of\nthe body corporate at that time; or\n(e) in the case of an unincorporated association—the person is a\nmember of the governing body of the unincorporated\nassociation at that time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-156-ss-4"
