      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, in writing, delegate all or any of the Minister’s\nfunctions or powers under this Act (other than the Minister’s power\nunder section 168) to any of the following:\n(a) the Digital ID Regulator;\n(b) the Secretary;\n(c) an SES employee or acting SES employee in the Department.\nNote:\nSections 34AA to 34A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 contain\nprovisions relating to delegations."
