    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-164",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "164 Delegation—Digital ID Regulator",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-164"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.179",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Digital ID Regulator may, by resolution, delegate all or any of\nthe Digital ID Regulator’s powers or functions under this Act to:\n(a) member of the Commission (within the meaning of the\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010); or\n(b) an SES employee, or an acting SES employee, in the\nAustralian Competition and Consumer Commission; or\n\nChapter 10  Other matters",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Digital ID Regulator may, by resolution, delegate all or any of\nthe Digital ID Regulator’s powers or functions under this Act to:\n(a) member of the Commission (within the meaning of the\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010); or\n(b) an SES employee, or an acting SES employee, in the\nAustralian Competition and Consumer Commission; or\n\nChapter 10  Other matters",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-164-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e8949a802223b527607357a64da9e790ba5b03adaa7167d801d073d441ac215f",
      "skos:note": "Delegation of powers or functions under this Act"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-164",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "164 Delegation—Digital ID Regulator",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 179,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Digital ID Regulator may, by resolution, delegate all or any of\nthe Digital ID Regulator’s powers or functions under this Act to:\n(a) member of the Commission (within the meaning of the\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010); or\n(b) an SES employee, or an acting SES employee, in the\nAustralian Competition and Consumer Commission; or\n\nChapter 10  Other matters"
    },
