    {
      "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-168",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "168 Rules—general matters",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-168"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.181",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make rules\nprescribing matters:\n(a) required or permitted by this Act to be prescribed by the\nrules; or\n(b) necessary or convenient to be prescribed for carrying out or\ngiving effect to this Act.\n(2) Without limiting subsection 33(3A) of the Acts Interpretation Act\n1901, the rules may prescribe a matter or thing differently for\ndifferent kinds of entities, things or circumstances.\n(3) The rules may make provision for or in relation to a matter by\nconferring a power on the Digital ID Regulator, the System\nAdministrator or the Minister to:\n(a) make an instrument of an administrative character; or\n\nChapter 10  Other matters",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make rules\nprescribing matters:\n(a) required or permitted by this Act to be prescribed by the\nrules; or\n(b) necessary or convenient to be prescribed for carrying out or\ngiving effect to this Act.\n(2) Without limiting subsection 33(3A) of the Acts Interpretation Act\n1901, the rules may prescribe a matter or thing differently for\ndifferent kinds of entities, things or circumstances.\n(3) The rules may make provision for or in relation to a matter by\nconferring a power on the Digital ID Regulator, the System\nAdministrator or the Minister to:\n(a) make an instrument of an administrative character; or\n\nChapter 10  Other matters",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-168-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-168-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-168-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4b48bd2fca3e8fc8901418feac1eca846dd4fabda8a22c5dbde27a37b554ed87"
    },
    {
