      },
      "dc:source": "digital-id-act-2024.pdf, p.182",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Subsections (1) and (2A) do not apply if:\n(a) the Minister is satisfied that there is an imminent threat to the\nAustralian Government Digital ID System; or\n(b) the Minister is satisfied that a hazard has had, or is having, a\nsignificant impact on the Australian Government Digital ID\nSystem.\nReview",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Subsections (1) and (2A) do not apply if:\n(a) the Minister is satisfied that there is an imminent threat to the\nAustralian Government Digital ID System; or\n(b) the Minister is satisfied that a hazard has had, or is having, a\nsignificant impact on the Australian Government Digital ID\nSystem.\nReview",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-169"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-169-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:digital-id-act-2024-sec-169-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "37326576d2b60e366755a7be73c08308bb42ed045bb7d037e0cd76f640479d2e",
      "skos:note": "Exemptions from subsections (1) and (2A)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/digital-id-act-2024#sec-169-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "169(4) Rules—requirement to consult",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 182,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Subsections (1) and (2A) do not apply if:\n(a) the Minister is satisfied that there is an imminent threat to the\nAustralian Government Digital ID System; or\n(b) the Minister is satisfied that a hazard has had, or is having, a\nsignificant impact on the Australian Government Digital ID\nSystem.\nReview"
    },
